# Origin + GitHub hosting

Development happens on Cursor Origin (`cursor.com/codebase`). Production
Cloudflare Workers Builds stays connected to GitHub
(`dylanfernandezdelara/congress-tracker`).

- Do **not** detach the Origin repo from GitHub.
- Do **not** remove the GitHub remote, delete `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, or
  reconnect Workers Builds to Origin (Cloudflare only supports GitHub/GitLab).
- Add Origin as a second remote (`cursor`) with `npm run remotes:origin`.
- Details: [`docs/ORIGIN.md`](docs/ORIGIN.md).
